===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Fraxure|111}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Dragon Claw}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Fraxure}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Fraxure}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

